{"real": true, "dur": 67.11, "sent": [{"start": 0.16, "end": 1.9, "text": "How do you build a catalogue?", "words": [{"w": "How", "s": 0.16}, {"w": "do", "s": 0.44}, {"w": "you", "s": 0.6}, {"w": "build", "s": 0.8}, {"w": "a", "s": 1.14}, {"w": "catalogue?", "s": 1.34}]}, {"start": 2.4, "end": 8.74, "text": "I use three sources: the textbook, the teacher’s guide and the publisher’s unit tests.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 2.4}, {"w": "use", "s": 2.58}, {"w": "three", "s": 2.84}, {"w": "sources:", "s": 3.18}, {"w": "the", "s": 4.22}, {"w": "textbook,", "s": 4.38}, {"w": "the", "s": 5.36}, {"w": "teacher’s", "s": 5.52}, {"w": "guide", "s": 6.06}, {"w": "and", "s": 6.88}, {"w": "the", "s": 7.04}, {"w": "publisher’s", "s": 7.22}, {"w": "unit", "s": 8.02}, {"w": "tests.", "s": 8.38}]}, {"start": 9.66, "end": 15.34, "text": "For example, if a unit test asks for something, it counts as taught in that unit.", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 9.66}, {"w": "example,", "s": 9.86}, {"w": "if", "s": 10.94}, {"w": "a", "s": 11.1}, {"w": "unit", "s": 11.28}, {"w": "test", "s": 11.66}, {"w": "asks", "s": 12.06}, {"w": "for", "s": 12.3}, {"w": "something,", "s": 12.52}, {"w": "it", "s": 13.44}, {"w": "counts", "s": 13.62}, {"w": "as", "s": 14.04}, {"w": "taught", "s": 14.28}, {"w": "in", "s": 14.64}, {"w": "that", "s": 14.84}, {"w": "unit.", "s": 15.06}]}, {"start": 15.82, "end": 22.48, "text": "So whenever I decide that something belongs in a particular unit, I need evidence from one of those three sources.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 15.82}, {"w": "whenever", "s": 16.28}, {"w": "I", "s": 16.86}, {"w": "decide", "s": 16.9}, {"w": "that", "s": 17.32}, {"w": "something", "s": 17.52}, {"w": "belongs", "s": 17.86}, {"w": "in", "s": 18.36}, {"w": "a", "s": 18.46}, {"w": "particular", "s": 18.58}, {"w": "unit,", "s": 19.18}, {"w": "I", "s": 20.0}, {"w": "need", "s": 20.08}, {"w": "evidence", "s": 20.36}, {"w": "from", "s": 20.82}, {"w": "one", "s": 21.04}, {"w": "of", "s": 21.18}, {"w": "those", "s": 21.34}, {"w": "three", "s": 21.7}, {"w": "sources.", "s": 21.98}]}, {"start": 23.34, "end": 27.04, "text": "In other words, I can’t just include something because I happen to know it.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 23.34}, {"w": "other", "s": 23.48}, {"w": "words,", "s": 23.68}, {"w": "I", "s": 24.38}, {"w": "can’t", "s": 24.5}, {"w": "just", "s": 24.76}, {"w": "include", "s": 25.02}, {"w": "something", "s": 25.44}, {"w": "because", "s": 25.82}, {"w": "I", "s": 26.28}, {"w": "happen", "s": 26.32}, {"w": "to", "s": 26.62}, {"w": "know", "s": 26.76}, {"w": "it.", "s": 26.94}]}, {"start": 27.44, "end": 28.98, "text": "Here are some examples.", "words": [{"w": "Here", "s": 27.44}, {"w": "are", "s": 27.7}, {"w": "some", "s": 27.94}, {"w": "examples.", "s": 28.22}]}, {"start": 28.98, "end": 45.26, "text": "“Quarter past” and “half past” aren’t in the French course, because the book tells the time as “nine fifteen” and “nine thirty.” On the other hand, “noon” and “midnight” are in, in Unit 2.", "words": [{"w": "“Quarter", "s": 28.98}, {"w": "past”", "s": 29.82}, {"w": "and", "s": 30.54}, {"w": "“half", "s": 30.64}, {"w": "past”", "s": 31.06}, {"w": "aren’t", "s": 31.84}, {"w": "in", "s": 32.56}, {"w": "the", "s": 32.68}, {"w": "French", "s": 32.82}, {"w": "course,", "s": 33.18}, {"w": "because", "s": 34.16}, {"w": "the", "s": 35.04}, {"w": "book", "s": 35.2}, {"w": "tells", "s": 35.5}, {"w": "the", "s": 35.82}, {"w": "time", "s": 35.98}, {"w": "as", "s": 36.42}, {"w": "“nine", "s": 36.66}, {"w": "fifteen”", "s": 37.54}, {"w": "and", "s": 38.5}, {"w": "“nine", "s": 38.6}, {"w": "thirty.”", "s": 39.0}, {"w": "On", "s": 40.44}, {"w": "the", "s": 40.58}, {"w": "other", "s": 40.74}, {"w": "hand,", "s": 40.98}, {"w": "“noon”", "s": 41.3}, {"w": "and", "s": 42.36}, {"w": "“midnight”", "s": 42.48}, {"w": "are", "s": 43.5}, {"w": "in,", "s": 43.76}, {"w": "in", "s": 44.44}, {"w": "Unit", "s": 44.66}, {"w": "2.", "s": 45.24}]}, {"start": 45.8, "end": 53.32, "text": "Also, whenever the book introduces a verb, learners practise it with all nine subject pronouns.", "words": [{"w": "Also,", "s": 45.8}, {"w": "whenever", "s": 46.68}, {"w": "the", "s": 47.2}, {"w": "book", "s": 47.34}, {"w": "introduces", "s": 47.94}, {"w": "a", "s": 48.74}, {"w": "verb,", "s": 48.86}, {"w": "learners", "s": 49.84}, {"w": "practise", "s": 50.42}, {"w": "it", "s": 50.84}, {"w": "with", "s": 51.1}, {"w": "all", "s": 51.46}, {"w": "nine", "s": 51.82}, {"w": "subject", "s": 52.26}, {"w": "pronouns.", "s": 52.74}]}, {"start": 53.84, "end": 66.16, "text": "And in Chinese, Lesson 11 teaches the time with its own words for “a quarter,” “three quarters” and “half.” So the Chinese course will teach them.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 53.84}, {"w": "in", "s": 54.12}, {"w": "Chinese,", "s": 54.3}, {"w": "Lesson", "s": 55.54}, {"w": "11", "s": 55.98}, {"w": "teaches", "s": 56.76}, {"w": "the", "s": 57.24}, {"w": "time", "s": 57.44}, {"w": "with", "s": 57.92}, {"w": "its", "s": 58.12}, {"w": "own", "s": 58.42}, {"w": "words", "s": 58.7}, {"w": "for", "s": 59.4}, {"w": "“a", "s": 59.5}, {"w": "quarter,”", "s": 59.78}, {"w": "“three", "s": 60.3}, {"w": "quarters”", "s": 61.2}, {"w": "and", "s": 62.28}, {"w": "“half.”", "s": 62.42}, {"w": "So", "s": 63.9}, {"w": "the", "s": 64.14}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 64.3}, {"w": "course", "s": 64.84}, {"w": "will", "s": 65.319}, {"w": "teach", "s": 65.56}, {"w": "them.", "s": 65.92}]}]}